{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36599","headline":"送郑州严员外 · 罗隐","name":"送郑州严员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲将刀笔润王猷，东去先分圣主忧。\n满扇好风吹郑圃，一车甘雨别皇州。\n尚书碛冷鸿声晚，仆射陂寒树影秋。\n从此文星在何处，武牢关外庾公楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36599.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36599","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}